  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.17.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.16.0:\n\n- Compare the number field as the text it is bound to ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Ask whether a number is whole without comparing two doubles ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Carry a member's metadata through generated C# and back ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Let the editor set a member's unit, range, default and encoding ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Give a member a unit, a range, a default, and how to send it ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Take the assertions SonarCloud's analyzer asked for ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
